                    }
                  }
                },
                {
                  "image": {
                    "$media": {
                      "url": "/_seed/media/kitchen-glass-cabinets.jpg",
                      "alt": "White kitchen with glass-front cabinets",
                      "filename": "kitchen-glass-cabinets.jpg"
                    }
                  }
                },
                {
                  "image": {
                    "$media": {
                      "url": "/_seed/media/backyard-dusk.jpg",
                      "alt": "Backyard at dusk with landscape lighting",
                      "filename": "backyard-dusk.jpg"
                    }
                  }
                }
              ],
              "primary_cta_label": "Start your project",
              "primary_cta_url": "/contact",
              "secondary_cta_label": "View our work",
              "secondary_cta_url": "/portfolio"
            },
            {
              "_type": "statement",
              "_version": 1,
              "_key": "statement",
              "eyebrow": "Our approach",
              "text": "A beautiful home starts with a builder who listens. We guide every project from first sketch to final walkthrough, and we keep it on budget and on schedule.",
              "signature": "Mia Marcantonio, Owner"
            },
            {
              "_type": "services",
              "_version": 1,
              "_key": "services",
              "eyebrow": "What we build",
              "headline": "No job too big or too small.",
              "intro": "From a ground-up custom home to a single room, every project gets the same care.",
              "items": [
                {
                  "title": "Custom homes",
                  "body": "Ground-up homes designed around how you live, coordinated with your architect and engineers from day one.",
                  "image": {
                    "$media": {
                      "url": "/_seed/media/farmhouse-entry-doors.jpg",
                      "alt": "French double entry doors",
                      "filename": "farmhouse-entry-doors.jpg"
                    }
                  }
                },
                {
                  "title": "Remodels and additions",
                  "body": "Whole-home renovations, second stories, and additions that feel like they were always there.",
                  "image": {
                    "$media": {
                      "url": "/_seed/media/great-room.jpg",
                      "alt": "Bright living room with French doors",
                      "filename": "great-room.jpg"
                    }
                  }
                },
                {
                  "title": "Kitchens and baths",
                  "body": "Cabinetry, stone, tile, and lighting brought together with tight detailing.",
                  "image": {
                    "$media": {
                      "url": "/_seed/media/kitchen-gray-shaker.jpg",
                      "alt": "Gray shaker kitchen",
                      "filename": "kitchen-gray-shaker.jpg"
                    }
                  }
                },
                {
                  "title": "Outdoor living",
                  "body": "Landscapes, hardscape, and lighting that extend the home outdoors.",
                  "image": {
                    "$media": {
                      "url": "/_seed/media/backyard-dusk.jpg",
                      "alt": "Backyard at dusk",
                      "filename": "backyard-dusk.jpg"
                    }
                  }
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "_type": "featured_projects",
              "_version": 1,
              "_key": "work",
              "eyebrow": "Portfolio",
              "headline": "Selected work",
              "intro": "A look at recent homes, remodels, and a custom build in progress.",
              "link_label": "View the full portfolio"
            },
            {
              "_type": "process",
              "_version": 1,
              "_key": "process",
              "eyebrow": "How we work",
              "headline": "A clear path from idea to keys.",
              "items": [
                {
                  "title": "Consultation",
                  "body": "We walk the site, listen to your goals, and talk honestly about budget and timing."
                },
                {
                  "title": "Design and planning",
                  "body": "We work with your architect and engineers on plans, pricing, and permits, so there are no surprises later."
                },
                {
                  "title": "Construction",
                  "body": "Licensed, bonded, and insured trade partners build to the plan while you get regular updates."
                },
                {
                  "title": "Walkthrough",
                  "body": "We review every detail with you and hand over a finished home, on time and on budget."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "_type": "story",
              "_version": 1,
              "_key": "owner",
              "eyebrow": "Meet the owner",
              "headline": "Thirty years of building, one standard.",
              "body": [
                {
                  "_type": "block",
                  "style": "normal",
                  "_key": "p0",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "_type": "span",
                      "_key": "s0",
                      "text": "Mia Marcantonio began her career at a structural engineering firm in Pasadena working on hospitals and schools, then moved to an architecture firm in Newport Beach. After seven years she turned to residential construction, working for two of the largest custom home builders in Orange County."
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "_type": "block",
                  "style": "normal",
                  "_key": "p1",
                  "children": [
